      "notifications": [
        {
          "title": "Live By The Sword",
          "text": "I waited for the merchant to leave his shop, keeping my bodies in the shadows.\nHe must have felt something was wrong; when I rushed him, he screamed and struggled. Even though I stuffed a rug into his mouth and tied him up quickly, this was noticed.\n\nI left a body to observe [icon=hommlet]Hommlet, as the rest of my bodies carried the merchant to the cave.\n\nSoon, people will come looking for him. I should absorb the merchant quickly.\n\nI don't like it when people are looking for my bodies.",
